English asset rules for the only English release on archive.org (Gary Gadget:
Building Cars, Viva Media 2006), which scripts/fetch_iso.sh remasters.

On that disc 92.DXR follows the other translations' numbering and 13.DXR and
88.DXR the Swedish one, so upstream's en: rules for them (made against some
other English edition) pick the wrong members. Checked by member name against
the Swedish CD, which also turned up two ranges upstream has no rule for:
the horns in 05.DXR and the last car-part voices in CDDATA.CXT, shifted by one.

